# Build-time configuration for the deployed frontend.
#
# The API does not live on the same origin as this site. The database is on the
# design department's own machine, and the API runs beside it so that a request
# does not cross the internet once per SQL query -- so the browser calls the
# API directly at the address below, and CORS on the API admits this site.
#
# Vite bakes VITE_* values in at BUILD time. Changing this needs a rebuild, not
# a restart, and a value set in the Vercel dashboard overrides this file.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://u1-l-2rkv8f4.tailc2b13d.ts.net
